r":"30","src":"api/label/293955","statements":[{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Promotes healthy weight management"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Science tells us a healthier weight contributes to a healthier life. If you're on that journey, our PureLean Weight Support pack is a great addition to a positive lifestyle routine that includes a healthy diet and exercise. This pack nourishes your body, may promote healthful eating patterns, ad can help with hose challenging cravings."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"PureLean Nutrients, a premium multivitamin/mineral formula, includes special features such as metabolic GlycoPlex to help support healthy glucose metabolism\r\nCarbCrave Complex helps lessen your appetite, helps moderate carbohydrate intake, and may promote healthful eating patterns\r\nCarbCrave Complex offers Sensoril ashwagandha to help strengthen the body's response to stress and fatigue - common triggers for stress related eating habits\r\nEach packet contains\r\n3 PureLean nutrients\r\n3 CarbCrave Complex\r\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Pills not shown to actual size."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Natural  capsule color variations can occur."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Recommendations: As a dietary supplement, take 1 pack daily (6 capsules), with a meal."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Cravings and appetite are influenced by many factors, only some of which may be affected by the ingredients in this formula."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Provides weight management support as part of a healthy lifestyle with a reduced-calorie diet and regular exercise."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Designed with pure integrity to promote healthy weight management"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Phenlyketonurics: Contains phenylalanine"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: not to be taken by pregnant or lactating women."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Take with food."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"If you have liver problems, consult your health professional before use."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Vitamin K may be contraindicated with Coumadin (Warfarin). If you have any health conditions or are taking medication, particularly psychiatric or blood-thinning medications, consult your health professional before use. Do not use concurrently with antidepressants."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Goodness encapsulated \r\nOur Daily Pure Packs include some of our best selling and unique formulations, carefully selected in collaboration with nutritional and medical experts to target specific health needs.\r\nDeveloped by nutritional & medical experts"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Our supplements are made using only premium ingredients backed by verifiable science and sourced from trusted suppliers, and are carefully manufactured to ensure they are free from:\r\nWheat, soy Except where labeled, dairy, egg\r\nTree nuts & peanuts\r\nGluten\r\nArtificial colors, flavors & sweeteners\r\nCoatings & shellacs\r\nGMOs\r\nUnnecessary binders, fillers & preservatives\r\nTrans fat & hydrogenated oils"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Visit PureEncapsulations.com for more information on our GMO policy."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"From the premium i